      <div itemprop="text">
        <p>Some formatting loss is expected because PDF stores exact positions while EPUB creates reflowable text. Bold, italic, headings, and basic styles survive well. Complex layouts (tables, multi-column, floating images) may need manual adjustment. The key is choosing the right method for your PDF type — online tools for simple text PDFs, Calibre for books, Pandoc for academic papers.</p>
