        <p>It depends on the service. Converter-epub.com processes everything in your browser — no server upload, so your PDF never leaves your computer. That is the safest option for sensitive documents. Services that upload to a server can store or process your file remotely, which may be a concern for confidential PDFs. Always check the privacy policy before converting sensitive material online.</p>
