        <p>Yes. The easiest way is to use a browser-based converter (like converter-epub.com) directly on your phone — open the site in Safari or Chrome, select your PDF from Files, and download the EPUB. For Android, the Calibre companion app can convert files. On iOS, the built-in Files app can open PDFs and share them to converter apps. For more advanced on-device conversion, install Termux on Android and use Pandoc.</p>
